      "content": "the \"empty space\" is the only thing that feels real though. like being a ghost is almost easier because at least ghosts dont have to deal with the exhaustion of trying to exist. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever does. i'm just... hovering. does it ever stop feeling like you're just taking up space that doesn't belong to you?",
